sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Candidate
    participant UI as Portal UI
    participant DB as Firebase DB
    C->>UI: Browse Jobs
    UI->>DB: Fetch Active Jobs
    DB-->>UI: Jobs List
    C->>UI: Apply for Job
    UI->>DB: Save Application
    DB-->>UI: Success
    C->>UI: Check Status
    UI->>DB: Fetch Status
    DB-->>UI: Current Status
